      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Return whether the package is being saved due to a procedural save.\nAny save without the possibility of user-generated edits to the package is a procedural save (Cooking, EditorDomain).\nThis allows us to execute transforms that only need to be executed in response to new user data.",
